      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استوقر وِقْرَهُ طَعَامًا</span></b>  <i>He took,</i> or <i>received,
his load,</i> or <i>heavy load, of wheat</i> or <i>other food.</i>
(K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استوقرت الإِبِلُ</span>, (K, TA,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استوقرت</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الإِبِلُ شَحْمًا</span> (A,) <i>The camels became fat;</i> (K;)
[lit.] <i>carried fat:</i> (TA:) or <i>became heavy with
fatness.</i> (A.)

